  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  isActiveDialogue: 0
  lines:
  - 'Hello, again! '
  - 'Great job! You''re now in the final level of stage RAM. '
  - This will be the hardest level you will take for the last round.
  - "I need your help again, because another problem arouse in my PC again \u2014
    it was beeping when I opened it.  "
  - 'I followed what you did in the previous level, but it''s still not working. '
  - Can you help me and take a look to figure out what's causing it?
  - Try to check the CPU's case one last time to see the problem.
  - Before you proceed in troubleshooting, don't forget to turn off the psu's switch
    first for safety purposes.
  - 'Follow the objectives and complete the level. '
  - Good luck!
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 194405020}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 636061765}
  speakerNameText: {fileID: 1190403014}
  speakerName: Azer
  animator: {fileID: 0}
