  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  isActiveDialogue: 0
  lines:
  - 'By the way, thank you for helping me in my RAM. '
  - "And I think another problem has come up with my PC again \u2014 it started beeping
    when I tried to turn it on."
  - Can you take a look and figure out what's causing it?
  - Before proceeding with troubleshooting, don't forget to turn off the PSU's switch
    for safety.
  - 'Follow the objectives and complete the level. '
  - Good luck!
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 377563305}
