  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  isActiveDialogue: 1
  lines:
  - Thanks for letting me in.
  - I need your help :<
  - "Before I tell you the problem \u2014 let's practice something quick."
  - See that power cable? Try plugging it into the PSU port at the back of the system
    unit.
  - Go ahead, give it a try!
